@startuml fifo-send
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Heiti SC"
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563eb
  ActorBorderColor #d1d5db
  ActorBackgroundColor #ffffff
  ActorFontColor #111827
  ParticipantBorderColor #d1d5db
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ffffff
  ParticipantFontColor #111827
  LifeLineBorderColor #d1d5db
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ffffff
  BoxBorderColor #d1d5db
  BoxBackgroundColor #f9fafb
  GroupBorderColor #d1d5db
  GroupBackgroundColor #f9fafb
}

title 顺序消息发送：messageGroup -> 固定队列 -> CommitLog
autonumber

actor App as "应用线程"
box "Client / rocketmq-clients" #eef6ff
participant Builder as "MessageBuilder\nclient/message"
participant Producer as "ProducerImpl\nclient/impl/producer"
participant Route as "PublishingLoadBalancer\nclient/impl/producer"
participant RPC as "ClientManager\nRpcClient"
end box
box "Proxy / rocketmq/proxy" #eefaf3
participant ProxySend as "SendMessageActivity\nProducerProcessor"
participant MsgSvc as "MessageService\nCluster / Local"
end box
box "Broker / rocketmq/broker" #fff7ed
participant Broker as "SendMessageProcessor\nbroker/processor"
end box
box "Store / rocketmq/store" #f5f3ff
participant Store as "DefaultMessageStore\nstore"
end box
box "CommitLog 写入层 / rocketmq/store" #fff1f2
participant CL as "CommitLog\nstore"
end box
box "Disk / broker store path" #f8fafc
database Disk as "服务端磁盘\ncommitlog files"
end box

App -> Builder: setMessageGroup(group)
Builder -> Builder: reject coexistence with\nDeliveryTimestamp/Lite/Priority
App -> Producer: send(message)
activate Producer
Producer -> Producer: PublishingMessageImpl -> MessageType.FIFO
Producer -> Producer: collect messageGroups\nmust be same group
Producer -> Route: takeMessageQueueByMessageGroup(group)
Route -> Route: sipHash24(group) % writableMasterQueues
Route --> Producer: singleton candidate queue
note right of Producer
FIFO 发送和重试都只使用该 group
映射出的同一个 queue
end note
Producer -> RPC: SendMessageRequest\nMessageType.FIFO + messageGroup + queueId
RPC -> ProxySend: gRPC SendMessage

activate ProxySend
ProxySend -> ProxySend: validate messageGroup
ProxySend -> ProxySend: put PROPERTY_SHARDING_KEY=messageGroup
ProxySend -> ProxySend: SendMessageQueueSelector\nconsistentHash(shardingKey)\nselect write queue
ProxySend -> ProxySend: TopicMessageType.validate(FIFO)
ProxySend -> MsgSvc: sendMessage(..., selectedQueue, header)
activate MsgSvc
MsgSvc -> Broker: SEND_MESSAGE_V2
deactivate MsgSvc

activate Broker
Broker -> Broker: build MessageExtBrokerInner\nproperties include SHARDING_KEY
Broker -> Store: asyncPutMessage / putMessage
activate Store
Store -> CL: asyncPutMessage(msgInner)
activate CL
CL -> CL: assign queue offset under topicQueueLock\nencode and append
CL -> Disk: append CommitLog and flush per config
CL --> Store: PutMessageResult
deactivate CL
Store --> Broker: PutMessageResult
deactivate Store
Broker --> ProxySend: SendResult(queueOffset)
deactivate Broker
ProxySend --> RPC: SendMessageResponse
deactivate ProxySend
RPC --> Producer: response
Producer --> App: SendReceipt
deactivate Producer

note over Store,CL
顺序语义依赖同一 messageGroup 固定到同一队列，
队列内 offset 单调递增；CommitLog 仍是全局追加文件。
end note

@enduml
